<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5580e5e02766> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Earlier this year, the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration found Tesla at fault for not providing enough Autopilot safeguards after a deadly Tesla crash." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1757" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/87ecffadcc0e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "As with this fatal Model X impact and this bizarre incident where a Model S failed to see a fire truck, Autopilot was engaged." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1718" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/acab91fc508c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The driver, You You Xue, said in a social media posting that the car swerved suddenly off course at a fork while in autopilot mode." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1720" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/eace43ed2cae> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The Model 3 was in northern Greece with its holidaying driver, You You Xue of California." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1718" .

