<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/abc5c593e1ea> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The police said that the driver of the Tesla electric vehicle, Huang, claimed to have the vehicle assist system turned on, and the speed was fixed at 110 kilometers per hour." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1757" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8f68c9faeb1a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla’s response, a statement sent to Electrek, said what we’ve also been trying to explain." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1718" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ff8a34159434> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "I am again disgusted by the various negative comments and personal attacks that have surfaced on the various Tesla Facebook groups, including suggestions that I am bringing the car back to the US to commit insurance fraud by pretending the collision happened there." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1719" .

